            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Benites, Eda Marcela and Algee-Hewitt, Bridget. (2020). De-essentializing 'Hispanic': A Critical Approach to Ancestry Estimation with FORDISC 3.1. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/dp028xq4706",
